        -:  199:// The tag is a type associated to the event type (which is an integer itself,
        -:  200:// in spite of its name) value. It exists in order to be used as a template
        -:  201:// parameter and provide a mapping between the event type values and their
        -:  202:// corresponding wxEvent-derived classes.
        -:  203:template <typename T>
        -:  204:class wxEventTypeTag
        -:  205:{
        -:  206:public:
        -:  207:    // The class of wxEvent-derived class carried by the events of this type.
        -:  208:    typedef T EventClass;
